krish: I have a long running temporal workflow, some instance of which can continue running indefinitely.

tihomir: Continueasnew completes current exec and atomically creates new one with same wfid. The continued exec is a new execution and it would run your workflow code from beginning.

yes, should check the isContinueAsNewSuggested flag see if true to decide to contiunueasnew, this flag addresses both event history count and size (is set to true on 4k event count, 4MB history size, whichever is reached first)
